{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons &amp; Dimensions is a focused, solo Action-Adventure where you conquer massive, unique fantasy worlds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an engaging, fully voice-acted storyline as you explore. Each Dimension holds a specific, self-contained narrative you must thoroughly explore, piece together its story, and overcome its challenges to unlock the path to the next dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and prepare for battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master casual Souls-like combat, accessible, but demanding in its preparation. Explore the world, gather items, and gain power to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find,\u00a0Recruit &amp; Risk your Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &amp; Collect dozens of unique heroes, each with specific strengths and weaknesses. You must find and complete their story to unlock them. If a hero dies, they are lost forever. Choose wisely who you risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>See you Dimensionalists !</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2813980?t=1764328414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764328414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764328414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764328414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons &amp; Dimensions is 